---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Contact Kobzy
description: "Contact Kobzy about a used car. Message us on WhatsApp or call — we're happy to send more photos, arrange a video call or book a viewing."
permalink: /contact/
---
<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="container">
    <h1>Get in touch</h1>
    <p class="page-hero-sub">Questions about a car? Want more photos or a video? We reply fast.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container contact-grid">
    <div class="contact-card">
      <h2>Message or call us</h2>
      <p>The quickest way to reach us is WhatsApp — send us a message and we'll get straight back to you with photos, a video, or to arrange a viewing.</p>

      <div class="contact-actions">
        <a class="btn btn-whatsapp" href="https://wa.me/{{ site.contact.whatsapp }}?text={{ site.contact.whatsappMessage | urlencode }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">WhatsApp {{ site.contact.phoneDisplay }}</a>
        <a class="btn btn-outline" href="tel:{{ site.contact.phoneLink }}">Call {{ site.contact.phoneDisplay }}</a>
        {% if site.contact.email %}<a class="btn btn-outline" href="mailto:{{ site.contact.email }}">Email us</a>{% endif %}
      </div>

      <h3>Opening hours</h3>
      <ul class="hours-list">
        {% for h in site.hours %}
          <li><span>{{ h.days }}</span><strong>{{ h.time }}</strong></li>
        {% endfor %}
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="contact-card contact-card-alt">
      <h2>Where we are</h2>
      <p>{{ site.location.serviceArea }}.</p>
      <p>Based in <strong>{{ site.location.town }}</strong>, {{ site.location.region }}. Viewings are by appointment — please message us first so we can have the car ready for you.</p>
      <p class="muted">Prefer a video call? Just ask and we'll walk you around the car live.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
